<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Geupec pays 6 centavo dividend.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Geupec pays 6 centavo dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican beverage company Grupo Embotelladoras Unidas (Geupec) decided to pay a dividend of six centavos per share on Wednesday, the company reported to the Mexican Stock Exchnage.</p>
<p>Geupec reported that its B series share price had been adjusted to 11.86 pesos, from 11.92 pesos on September 6.</p>
<p>-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9562</p>
</text>
